    title: "The Korean Variant Archive (KOVA): a reference database of genetic variations in the Korean population"
    year: 2017
    journal: "Scientific Reports"
    doi: "10.1038/s41598-017-04642-4"
    notes: "Author list, volume, and article number: see the publisher record at doi:10.1038/s41598-017-04642-4."
    authors:
      - name: "See publisher record at doi:10.1038/s41598-017-04642-4"
